                           <h2>The Athletics Office</h2>
                           
                           <hr>
                           
                           <p>The official <a href="https://www.wsccathletics.com/landing/index">Walters State Community College athletics website</a>&nbsp;serves as the primary digital home for the Senators and Lady Senators. Designed for
                              student-athletes, alumni, and fans, the portal delivers up-to-the-minute coverage
                              of the college's NJCAA and TCCAA sports programs, including real-time scoreboards,
                              full season schedules, and game recaps. Visitors can stream live events, explore championship
                              history, track NIL guidelines, and support the college's athletic tradition through
                              the Senators Club.</p>
                           
                           <p><span>
                                 <a href="https://www.wsccathletics.com/landing/index" target="_self" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-specialty-primary  ">Visit the Athletics Page</a> 
                                 </span></p>
                           
                           <p>&nbsp;</p>
                           
                           <h3>Contact Information</h3>
                           
                           <p>Walters State Athletic Dept<br>500 S. Davy Crockett Pkwy<br>Morristown, TN 37813<br>Fax: 423.318.2579</p>
                           
                           <p>&nbsp;</p>
                           </div>
                        </div>
